<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

<title>Quiz Result</title>

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">

<style>

body{
background: linear-gradient(135deg,#667eea,#764ba2);
height:100vh;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

.result-card{
background:white;
padding:40px;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
text-align:center;
width:500px;
}

.result-card h1{
color:#28a745;
font-weight:bold;
}

.score{
font-size:40px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#ff5722;
}

img{
width:150px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="result-card">

<img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2278/2278992.png">

<h1>🎉 Congratulations! 🎉</h1>

<p>You have completed the quiz successfully.</p>

<div class="score">

<%=score%> / 30

</div>

<p class="mt-2">Great job! Keep learning and improving 🚀</p>

<a href="/quiz/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary mt-3 me-2">
🏠 Go Home
</a>

<a href="/quiz/leaderboard" class="btn btn-warning mt-3">
🏆 View Leaderboard
</a>

</div>

</body>

</html>